@startuml
title BPO Management System State Transition Diagram

[*] --> SelectFilterCategory

state "Select Filter Category" as SelectFilterCategory
SelectFilterCategory : entry / Get the list of filter categories
SelectFilterCategory : do / Display the list to user
SelectFilterCategory : exit / User selects a category or cancels

' select category loop
SelectFilterCategory --> SelectPriceRange : [User selects a category]

state "Select Price Range" as SelectPriceRange
SelectPriceRange : entry / Get the price range options
SelectPriceRange : do / Display the list to user
SelectPriceRange : exit / User selects a price range or cancels

' select price range loop
SelectPriceRange --> SearchResults : [User selects a price range]

state "Search Results" as SearchResults
SearchResults : entry / Get the search results based on filter criteria
SearchResults : do / Display the matching users to user
SearchResults : exit / User views results or cancels

' view results loop
SearchResults --> [*] : [User views results]
SearchResults --> SelectFilterCategory : [User wants to change filters]

@enduml
